functionalities without the details of how.
Class Encapsulation
to bundle the data and methods related
to an object into a single unit.
to allow using a protective shield to
prevent accessing the data by the code
outside this shield. Concepts of Encapsulation and Abstraction (C#) (completecsharptutorial.com)
